# Wanderbite design rules

Source of truth: `design-handoff/DESIGN_SPEC.md`, `design-handoff/BEA_AI_SPEC.md`, the mockups in `design-handoff/mockups/`.

## Look
- Fonts: `font-display` = Instrument Serif (headlines, big numbers, restaurant names, Bea's italic voice). `font-sans` = Outfit (all UI). No other fonts.
- One italic accent word per headline: blush `#ffc9d6` on dark, `#be185d` on cream.
- Colors only from the `--wb-*` tokens in `src/app/styles/wanderbite-theme.css`. Brand violet `#7c3aed`, rose `#fb7185`, night `#120a24`, cream `#faf6ef`.
- Primary CTA = `.wb-cta` gradient (`#8b5cf6 → #db2777`). Secondary on dark = glass outline; on cream = plum `#2a1442` or outlined.
- Public/Discover pages: dark, full-bleed photo, glass panels.
- Member pages: dark cinematic header + cream sheet (`.wb-sheet`, -30px overlap, 32px top radius). Content mostly unboxed; cards only for objects (tickets, memories, next-move).
- Mobile nav: floating dark glass tab bar (Discover, Challenges, Progress, Passport).
- Radii: pills 999px, cards 22–28px, sheet 32px. Touch targets ≥ 44px.

## Motion
- One signature motion per screen + quiet ambient loops (drift, aurora, glow border). Use the CSS utilities in `src/app/styles/wanderbite-theme.css`. Page transitions and the stamp slam may add Motion in the slice that needs it, respecting `prefers-reduced-motion`. Until then use those CSS utilities.
- Always respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Never animate a claim the system isn't actually making. No animation on the redemption QR.

## Photos
- `next/image`, fixed aspect frames, `object-fit: cover`, dark overlays for legibility. Keep Google Places attribution inside the frame. Decode HTML entities in credits.

## Honesty and data
- Never show hardcoded or mock progress. Read progress from the existing server data sources for challenges and redemptions.
- Statuses: ready → code_issued → verified → note_added (+ expired, swapped). An issued code is not a visit.
- Label estimates ("saved so far (estimated)"). Show "pending"/"can't confirm" when true.
- Notes are private by default; show a Private/Public badge + toggle wherever a note is shown.
- Don't show discounts that aren't currently available. Checkout status copy must match reality.
- Canonical URL is `https://wanderbite.co`.
- Member progress (streak, visits, badges, level, and savings) is read from `getMemberProgress()` in `src/lib/progress/get-member-progress.ts`. `DiscoverEvent` is not in `src/` yet.

## Bea (AI)
- For Discover, render only the thinking steps the current `/api/roulette` response actually provides.
- Dietary constraints are hard filters, including in fallback. Keep the allergy notice.
- Results show matched / unknown / unmet constraints honestly.
- Render Bea only through `<Bea />` from `src/components/bea/Bea.tsx` (`state`: idle | thinking | found, `food`). Her motion lives in the SVG avatar (`src/components/bea/BeaAvatar.tsx`) and its CSS in `src/app/styles/wanderbite-theme.css`. Extend those for new states rather than adding `@rive-app` or `.riv` files. `design-handoff/RIVE_BRIEF.md` and `design-handoff/code/BeaAvatarRive.tsx` are reference only.

## Accessibility
- Real `<button>`/`<a>`/`<label>`; `aria-label` on icon-only buttons; decorative SVGs `aria-hidden`.
- Contrast ≥ 4.5:1. Status never by color alone. Visible focus rings. `aria-live="polite"` on thinking steps and verification status.
